cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Agentic-AI Containment RCSA: A Reusable Instrument and Worked Example"
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "socragpt"
abstract: >-
  An independent, open Risk & Control Self-Assessment (RCSA) instrument for the
  frontier AI model-evaluation and research-compute process, shipped with a
  worked example based on the publicly documented 2026 OpenAI-Hugging Face
  agent-containment incident. Includes a fillable Excel instrument (risk
  register, control library, action plan, KRI/KCI register, risk-appetite model
  and profile summary), a methodology, and a narrative report. Compiled solely
  from public sources; not affiliated with or endorsed by OpenAI or Hugging Face.
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-31"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/socragpt/agentic-ai-containment-rcsa"
